# Linkouts image builds use the monorepo root as context but need only this application.
# The allowlist prevents local data, credentials, and unrelated projects reaching a remote builder.
*
!sites/
sites/*
!sites/linkouts/
sites/linkouts/_build/
sites/linkouts/deps/
sites/linkouts/assets/node_modules/
sites/linkouts/priv/static/assets/
sites/linkouts/priv/static/cache_manifest.json
sites/linkouts/tmp/
sites/linkouts/cover/
sites/linkouts/doc/
sites/linkouts/priv/plts/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
!**/.env.example
!**/.envrc.example
**/erl_crash.dump
**/*.ez
**/npm-debug.log
